# trs-only golden-compared sweep design: no reference Bluesim
# executable exists by design (classic Bluesim refuses the design
# class).  The sweep gates the classic refusal tag, links/runs with
# the bindings below, byte-compares stdout against
# <top>.out.expected, and ASSERTS the engine outcome.
refuse=G0099
bind=big=0x0123456789ABCDEF0FEDCBA9
bind=inc=3
engine=aot
